[47.11,"o","  \u001b[2mClaude on macOS stores live auth in Keychain. Switching this profile may trigger a macOS Keychain prompt so aisw can update Claude's active credentials.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1mClaude Code → personal\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m──────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mAuth          :\u001b[0m \u001b[36mapi-key\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mBackend       :\u001b[0m file\r\n  \u001b[2mState mode    :\u001b[0m isolated\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m\u001b[1mEffects\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[32mLive tool configuration updated.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[32mActive profile updated.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[32mClaude will use isolated profile state when shell integration is active.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[32mBackup created before switching.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1mNext\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[36mRun 'aisw status' to confirm the current state.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
